    "urn:li:comment:(activity:7490570860181983232,7493083360483950593)": {
      "comment_urn": "urn:li:comment:(activity:7490570860181983232,7493083360483950593)",
      "commented_at": "2026-08-11T23:18:07Z",
      "verb": "commented",
      "text": "I agree the open-source part is the part worth watching most, because that is where it stops feeling like a test and starts feeling real.\n\nI think in the near future we may not use this pattern that much, because Claude Code can just write the code instead of importing it. Which makes the remaining part even more dangerous.",
